HELPFUL HINTS  

TEXT_COLOR 84    
TEXT_POS 11 18
1) Watch your shield level carefully!
Once you get the "Shield Low" warning
message, you will lose a special weapon
with each hit.  You may want to top the
shield off before beginning each level.


TEXT_POS 11 83
2) If possible, buy the Phase
Shield.  It gives you an extra edge
that will more than likely get you out
of some nasty situations.
